WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.039
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.130 --> 01:42.940
[Episode 1]

01:45.729 --> 01:47.300
Liu Shao.

01:53.979 --> 01:56.020
I want you to walk out of this yard

01:57.490 --> 01:59.020
and do many great things.

02:00.940 --> 02:03.460
But do you want to trade your fate for it?

02:04.580 --> 02:05.100
Okay.

02:06.060 --> 02:06.980
I promise you.

02:09.690 --> 02:11.690
I will be here with you for three days

02:12.140 --> 02:13.540
and do whatever you want.

02:15.860 --> 02:17.720
No matter wherever you want to go,

02:18.340 --> 02:19.770
I will take you there.

02:29.420 --> 02:30.420
Wow.

02:34.020 --> 02:35.220
It's been three days.

02:35.820 --> 02:36.950
It's time to go back.

02:39.140 --> 02:41.380
Can I see you again?

02:44.180 --> 02:45.220
Ten years later,

02:46.620 --> 02:47.900
If fate is not over,

02:49.380 --> 02:50.980
we will eventually meet.

03:00.700 --> 03:01.300
My Lady.

03:02.010 --> 03:02.700
My Lady.

03:06.810 --> 03:10.300
[Daughter of Liu family, Liu Shao]

03:18.380 --> 03:19.140
I knew

03:19.700 --> 03:21.260
you must have fallen asleep here.

03:20.550 --> 03:24.240
[Maid of Liu family, Xiaolian]

03:21.900 --> 03:24.300
Did you dream of

03:24.420 --> 03:27.750
the immortal who had a promise and be with you for three days?

03:28.100 --> 03:29.900
I know. You don't believe me.

03:30.740 --> 03:31.660
My parents said

03:31.940 --> 03:34.340
I slept under a pear tree for a while.

03:35.060 --> 03:35.820
But

03:36.700 --> 03:38.740
I did meet that immortal.

03:40.700 --> 03:42.140
He said

03:42.500 --> 03:44.060
he changed my fate.

03:44.579 --> 03:45.700
Ten years later,

03:45.900 --> 03:47.020
I will have

03:47.300 --> 03:49.140
a completely different life.

03:50.180 --> 03:51.370
Think about it.

03:51.540 --> 03:52.540
It's been

03:52.820 --> 03:54.260
over ten years.

03:56.740 --> 03:57.460
My Lady,

03:57.860 --> 03:59.420
I think you're just bored.

03:59.900 --> 04:01.300
I don't know why Od Master

04:01.450 --> 04:02.850
won't allow you to go out.

04:02.980 --> 04:03.980
He told us

04:04.500 --> 04:05.740
you will bring demons

04:06.260 --> 04:07.220
when you go out.

04:08.410 --> 04:09.060
Nonsense!

04:09.420 --> 04:11.060
I won't bring demons.

04:12.260 --> 04:13.140
My father said

04:14.620 --> 04:16.579
I can go out

04:18.220 --> 04:19.750
after my birthday tonight.

04:30.890 --> 04:32.490
[Lu Sheng's Manor]

04:40.050 --> 04:43.580
[Half Demon, Lu Sheng]

04:52.930 --> 04:53.620
Enough.

04:54.140 --> 04:55.340
You two go.

05:02.900 --> 05:03.540
Li,

05:04.740 --> 05:06.340
take a rest

05:08.420 --> 05:10.060
and get ready for tonight.

05:21.460 --> 05:24.230
[Jade Pavilion]

05:38.130 --> 05:39.260
The immortal said

05:39.370 --> 05:40.830
we will meet when I grow up.

05:41.620 --> 05:43.460
I'm turning 18 today.

05:44.100 --> 05:45.100
I'm a grown-up.

05:49.690 --> 05:50.500
Maybe

05:50.980 --> 05:52.740
I'll see the immortal soon.

05:54.340 --> 05:55.100
Shao.

05:54.470 --> 05:56.990
[Liu Shao's parents]

05:56.020 --> 05:56.950
Father, Mother.

06:01.340 --> 06:01.860
See.

06:02.180 --> 06:03.380
These longans

06:03.460 --> 06:04.420
are very fresh.

06:06.940 --> 06:07.580
Shao,

06:08.100 --> 06:08.830
you can go out

06:08.940 --> 06:09.860
after today.

06:09.980 --> 06:11.240
Are you happy about it?

06:12.540 --> 06:14.660
You are the best to me.

06:34.500 --> 06:35.540
What happened?

06:37.340 --> 06:38.100
Shao, you...

06:52.420 --> 06:53.950
It's the Mysterious Light.

07:22.500 --> 07:23.430
What's going on?

07:23.580 --> 07:24.620
Who is laughing?

07:32.700 --> 07:33.159
Mother!

07:33.460 --> 07:34.980
Help! Help!

07:37.940 --> 07:38.930
Help!

07:39.770 --> 07:41.020
What's going on?

07:52.610 --> 07:53.420
Demons.

07:54.580 --> 07:55.580
Don't come over!

08:05.420 --> 08:06.740
I’m here.

08:07.060 --> 08:09.060
Leave now!

08:25.000 --> 08:28.650
[Demon King of the Land, Ao Hen]

08:28.260 --> 08:29.300
Fairy.

08:29.580 --> 08:30.910
Thank you for saving us.

08:31.580 --> 08:32.090
Father.

08:32.860 --> 08:33.740
She is not a fairy.

08:33.740 --> 08:34.940
She is a big demon.

08:34.940 --> 08:35.539
Big demon?

08:35.700 --> 08:36.500
Big demon!

08:36.500 --> 08:37.940
Protect Miss Liu! Hurry!

08:38.059 --> 08:38.740
Hurry!

08:39.780 --> 08:40.780
Protect Miss Liu!

08:41.539 --> 08:42.659
Girl,

08:43.059 --> 08:44.190
you know something.

08:45.130 --> 08:46.580
You even know I'm

08:47.100 --> 08:48.460
a big demon.

08:48.940 --> 08:49.820
No wonder

08:50.060 --> 08:51.900
you are the chosen one.

08:53.420 --> 08:55.100
But from today onwards,

08:55.210 --> 08:56.460
you

08:57.180 --> 08:59.180
will belong to my son.

09:02.220 --> 09:03.740
Hurry! Protect Miss Liu!

09:03.740 --> 09:04.400
Be careful!

09:37.500 --> 09:38.140
Run!

09:38.660 --> 09:39.740
Run, Liu Shao!

09:45.860 --> 09:46.540
Mother.

09:51.940 --> 09:53.180
Come at me.

09:53.340 --> 09:54.540
Don't hurt my family.

09:59.700 --> 10:00.620
Mother.

10:19.690 --> 10:20.980
Young girl,

10:21.220 --> 10:22.900
you are quite bold.

10:23.460 --> 10:24.790
Aren't you afraid of me?

10:25.180 --> 10:26.540
I'm not afraid of you.

10:27.100 --> 10:28.140
You can't kill me.

10:28.730 --> 10:29.820
It's not the day.

10:30.220 --> 10:31.780
I need to see the mountains, rivers,

10:31.780 --> 10:32.930
and the stars of the world.

10:32.930 --> 10:34.590
I won't be killed by you today.

10:35.260 --> 10:36.060
Really?

10:36.900 --> 10:38.140
Unfortunately, the Mysterious Light in your body

10:38.140 --> 10:40.940
will bring disaster to you and your family.

10:41.220 --> 10:43.420
You will be chased by the Demons.

10:44.020 --> 10:47.080
Do you think you can still see the mountains and rivers?

11:22.500 --> 11:23.430
Father, Mother.

11:24.860 --> 11:25.450
Mother.

11:33.010 --> 11:34.060
Who are you?

11:34.260 --> 11:36.970
I hunt demons like you who bring disasters to the mortal world.

11:36.970 --> 11:40.710
[Demon Hunter, Lu Li]

11:39.580 --> 11:40.980
I'm a demon hunter, Lu Li.

12:25.900 --> 12:26.610
Watch out!

12:41.020 --> 12:42.460
You are as weak as an ant.

12:42.980 --> 12:45.260
How dare you fight against me?

12:47.180 --> 12:48.380
So what if I'm an ant?

12:48.900 --> 12:50.300
Ants dare to tumble a tree

12:50.300 --> 12:51.420
and the sky.

12:53.340 --> 12:54.500
You ask for it.

12:55.580 --> 12:56.450
Ao Hen.

13:02.060 --> 13:02.700
Lu Sheng.

13:03.170 --> 13:04.340
What are you doing here?

13:04.340 --> 13:05.500
Long time no see.

13:07.940 --> 13:08.860
Could it be...

13:08.860 --> 13:10.740
this arrogant guy

13:11.260 --> 13:12.420
is your disciple?

13:13.420 --> 13:14.090
Listen.

13:14.460 --> 13:16.580
Even with your formation,

13:17.450 --> 13:19.700
this ant will die anyway.

13:19.700 --> 13:20.380
Really?

13:21.380 --> 13:23.700
Then please open your eyes and see

13:23.970 --> 13:25.820
if he's an ant.

14:43.340 --> 14:44.070
Impossible.

14:44.340 --> 14:46.140
It can't be the power of a mortal.

15:11.300 --> 15:12.420
It seems that

15:12.660 --> 15:14.520
everything is going as expected.

15:24.820 --> 15:27.970
[Mansion of Wu Yang Duke]

15:31.090 --> 15:33.060
Last night, there was a sudden Mysterious Light.

15:33.060 --> 15:35.090
I heard that the Mysterious Light attracted hundreds of demons.

15:35.090 --> 15:36.980
Even the demon Ao Hen was there.

15:37.220 --> 15:38.140
Is that true?

15:38.860 --> 15:39.740
Yes.

15:41.020 --> 15:43.220
She went for a girl named Liu Shao.

15:41.030 --> 15:44.050
[Guard of Wu Yang Duke, Fang Zhan]

15:44.330 --> 15:45.140
But Ao Hen

15:45.460 --> 15:46.720
was defeated and left.

15:47.580 --> 15:49.010
[Wu]

15:47.740 --> 15:48.260
Chong,

15:49.660 --> 15:50.850
go check it.

15:50.430 --> 15:53.080
[Bird Demon]

15:51.420 --> 15:52.340
Ao Hen showed up

15:52.340 --> 15:54.070
and we can't just sit and watch.

15:54.460 --> 15:55.260
If necessary,

15:55.470 --> 15:59.300
[Eldest Disciple of Wu Yang Duke, Du Mingchong]

15:56.260 --> 15:59.990
take this girl back to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke to and protect her.

16:09.620 --> 16:11.140
Why hasn't he woken up?

16:11.140 --> 16:12.490
Is he okay?

16:13.100 --> 16:14.360
He was just exhausted.

16:14.940 --> 16:16.470
He'll be fine after a sleep.

16:26.060 --> 16:26.820
My Lady.

16:28.420 --> 16:29.140
My Lady.

16:29.260 --> 16:31.060
Someone from the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke is here.

16:31.060 --> 16:32.390
Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

16:33.060 --> 16:35.320
Are they here to help us get rid of demons?

16:35.340 --> 16:35.940
I'll check it out.

16:35.940 --> 16:36.470
Let's go.

16:45.740 --> 16:46.740
Does it hurt?

16:50.860 --> 16:51.740
Actually,

16:52.100 --> 16:52.540
I'm...

16:52.860 --> 16:53.700
fine.

16:54.220 --> 16:55.060
But Master,

16:55.420 --> 16:56.750
you are really amazing.

16:57.980 --> 16:58.930
How did you know

16:59.420 --> 17:01.220
the big demon would show up here?

17:09.900 --> 17:10.380
Li,

17:11.329 --> 17:12.380
take this

17:13.579 --> 17:14.500
talisman.

17:16.369 --> 17:18.940
I will use the formation to help you.

17:20.380 --> 17:22.740
You must protect Miss Liu.

17:25.300 --> 17:25.859
Master.

17:26.700 --> 17:27.460
Well.

17:28.099 --> 17:29.780
She's just an ordinary girl.

17:30.540 --> 17:31.580
I don't think

17:32.740 --> 17:35.140
there's something special about Miss Liu.

17:35.380 --> 17:36.300
These demons

17:36.500 --> 17:37.500
valued her so much

17:37.740 --> 17:38.940
and all ran after her.

17:39.220 --> 17:41.260
I guess Ao Hen won't give up easily.

17:42.010 --> 17:43.140
I need one more thing

17:43.340 --> 17:44.620
to keep Miss Liu safe.

17:45.300 --> 17:46.300
Go get it.

17:48.500 --> 17:49.300
Do we need to

17:49.820 --> 17:51.180
say goodbye to Miss Liu?

17:52.290 --> 17:53.660
No.

17:56.980 --> 17:58.780
Is your daughter a noble person?

17:59.020 --> 18:00.820
How dare she keep Mr. Du waiting?

18:03.620 --> 18:04.740
She will be right here.

18:04.740 --> 18:05.460
Have some tea.

18:05.460 --> 18:06.570
This is the best Biluochun tea.

18:06.570 --> 18:07.030
Father.

18:07.410 --> 18:07.850
Father.

18:07.850 --> 18:10.370
Is someone from the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke here?

18:10.370 --> 18:11.340
Mr. Du,

18:11.340 --> 18:13.060
this is my daughter, Liu Shao.

18:13.540 --> 18:14.100
Liu Shao,

18:14.180 --> 18:16.050
this is Mr. Du from the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

18:16.050 --> 18:18.250
He is the first disciple of Wu Yang Duke.

18:18.540 --> 18:19.500
Mr. Du.

18:19.810 --> 18:20.740
You are Liu Shao?

18:21.140 --> 18:21.670
Was Ao Hen

18:22.140 --> 18:23.170
here for you?

18:23.660 --> 18:24.260
Yes.

18:26.260 --> 18:27.320
How on earth did you

18:27.460 --> 18:28.540
offend her?

18:28.860 --> 18:29.980
I didn't.

18:30.330 --> 18:31.570
If you didn't,

18:31.780 --> 18:33.380
why did a demon like Ao Hen

18:33.540 --> 18:35.060
come here

18:35.060 --> 18:37.260
and try to kill an ordinary person like you?

18:37.260 --> 18:38.020
Mr. Du,

18:38.020 --> 18:39.180
please be reasonable.

18:39.180 --> 18:40.410
A murderer kills people

18:40.410 --> 18:41.300
and brings disasters to people.

18:41.300 --> 18:43.500
It is the murderer who should be blamed.

18:43.700 --> 18:44.660
Moreover,

18:44.810 --> 18:46.020
I didn't offend her.

18:46.380 --> 18:47.620
Even if I did,

18:47.770 --> 18:49.170
do I deserve to be killed?

18:51.220 --> 18:52.150
What do you mean?

18:52.220 --> 18:53.380
Are you lecturing me?

18:53.380 --> 18:54.240
-My lord. -I...

18:55.740 --> 18:56.260
My lord.

18:57.340 --> 19:00.420
My daughter has stayed at home for a long time. She didn't mean it.

19:00.420 --> 19:02.220
Please forgive her.

19:09.780 --> 19:11.900
Fine, you know the rules.

19:15.140 --> 19:16.020
Mr. Du,

19:16.460 --> 19:18.260
when can the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke catch

19:18.260 --> 19:19.120
that big demon?

19:19.380 --> 19:20.420
It's not easy

19:20.620 --> 19:22.020
to catch such a big demon.

19:22.580 --> 19:23.100
Okay.

19:23.220 --> 19:23.940
I know

19:24.020 --> 19:25.020
the situation here.

19:25.020 --> 19:26.480
I will report it to my Lord.

19:28.460 --> 19:30.860
How could you take the money and do nothing?

19:31.860 --> 19:33.300
I thought you were a hero.

19:35.100 --> 19:37.570
How dare you be rude to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

19:37.570 --> 19:38.500
I won't argue with you

19:38.500 --> 19:39.830
because of your father.

19:39.940 --> 19:41.180
How dare you talk nonsense here?

19:41.180 --> 19:42.540
Anyone who enters the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke

19:42.540 --> 19:43.700
are the best.

19:43.900 --> 19:46.060
The Mansion of Wu Yang Duke is the safest place

19:46.060 --> 19:47.580
with the Protection Spell.

19:47.580 --> 19:48.580
Can you go there?

19:49.740 --> 19:50.900
Why not?

19:51.340 --> 19:52.020
Listen.

19:52.460 --> 19:53.980
I will walk into the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke

19:53.980 --> 19:55.940
on my own.

19:56.180 --> 19:58.260
Okay, I'll wait.

19:59.500 --> 19:59.700
Let's go.

19:59.700 --> 20:00.300
My lord.

20:00.300 --> 20:00.820
My lord.

20:00.900 --> 20:01.900
Don't be angry.

20:01.900 --> 20:03.540
My lord, please don't be angry.

20:03.540 --> 20:04.140
My lord.

20:13.100 --> 20:14.940
He called himself the first disciple of the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

20:14.940 --> 20:15.980
He is nothing.

20:16.740 --> 20:18.020
I think

20:18.260 --> 20:19.900
Mr. Lu is 100 times better than him.

20:19.900 --> 20:20.980
Of course.

20:24.410 --> 20:26.530
Does Mr. Lu who appeared in front of you

20:26.530 --> 20:28.900
look like the immortal you saw?

20:30.660 --> 20:31.340
My Lady.

20:31.700 --> 20:32.460
My Lady.

20:32.700 --> 20:34.300
What are you thinking about?

20:34.620 --> 20:36.810
Actually, he does.

20:37.700 --> 20:38.620
How about

20:39.820 --> 20:40.460
we

20:40.610 --> 20:41.860
go find him together?

20:46.580 --> 20:47.620
My Lady,

20:47.620 --> 20:48.980
I was just saying.

20:48.980 --> 20:50.340
Are you really looking for him?

20:50.340 --> 20:52.340
How could Mr. Lu be an immortal?

20:53.010 --> 20:54.540
I think he is.

20:54.620 --> 20:57.080
Otherwise, how could he save me at that time?

20:57.860 --> 20:59.090
The immortal said

20:59.220 --> 21:01.260
he would come back when I grow up.

21:02.620 --> 21:03.620
Didn't you say

21:03.620 --> 21:05.580
he does business at Moon River?

21:06.660 --> 21:07.540
Where is he?

21:07.850 --> 21:08.940
I just heard about it.

21:08.940 --> 21:10.330
Desserts.

21:13.900 --> 21:15.230
If Old Master finds out,

21:15.380 --> 21:16.500
I will be doomed.

21:16.500 --> 21:17.420
If Old Master finds out,

21:17.420 --> 21:18.410
I will be doomed.

21:18.410 --> 21:19.740
Can you say something else?

21:19.740 --> 21:20.780
My Lady.

21:20.780 --> 21:21.460
All right.

21:21.980 --> 21:22.940
Let's go over there

21:22.940 --> 21:24.270
and then we will go home.

21:26.460 --> 21:27.890
Catch the moon.

21:28.090 --> 21:29.460
Catch the moon.

21:36.260 --> 21:38.740
Don't miss it.

21:41.330 --> 21:43.540
Don't miss it.

21:44.140 --> 21:45.740
Don't miss this opportunity.

21:45.740 --> 21:46.670
He's over there.

21:48.540 --> 21:49.420
My Lady.

21:50.300 --> 21:52.380
You really don't know how good this deal is.

21:52.380 --> 21:53.440
It's only one tael.

21:53.580 --> 21:55.260
You can't lose anything.

22:15.540 --> 22:16.540
Wait for me.

22:31.380 --> 22:32.310
Why are you here?

22:32.540 --> 22:33.940
I'm going to catch the moon in the Moon River.

22:33.940 --> 22:35.070
Are you going or not?

22:35.220 --> 22:36.170
You must be Mr. Lu.

22:36.170 --> 22:37.630
I've been looking for you.

22:38.540 --> 22:39.330
Really?

22:40.260 --> 22:41.980
Miss, why are you looking for me?

22:41.980 --> 22:43.380
Because you saved me that day.

22:43.380 --> 22:44.300
So today,

22:44.420 --> 22:45.820
I'm here to thank you.

22:46.860 --> 22:48.060
Where are you going?

22:49.140 --> 22:49.860
I...

22:50.450 --> 22:51.900
I'm going to catch the moon.

22:51.900 --> 22:53.160
I only charge one tael.

22:53.380 --> 22:54.710
Do you want to go with me?

22:54.980 --> 22:55.540
Okay.

22:55.660 --> 22:56.260
Let's go.

22:57.500 --> 22:58.900
Let me ask you something.

23:00.100 --> 23:00.630
Go ahead.

23:01.100 --> 23:02.140
I have a friend.

23:02.580 --> 23:04.440
She met an immortal ten years ago.

23:05.100 --> 23:06.900
She said he descended from the sky

23:06.900 --> 23:08.700
and brought her to fly to the sky.

23:08.780 --> 23:10.140
You are well-informed.

23:10.660 --> 23:11.340
Then,

23:11.340 --> 23:13.200
have you seen an immortal before?

23:14.060 --> 23:15.820
Your friend must have a dream.

23:16.260 --> 23:17.300
I've only seen demons

23:17.300 --> 23:19.030
with my master for these years.

23:19.380 --> 23:20.700
All immortals are living in

23:20.700 --> 23:21.620
the immortal world.

23:21.620 --> 23:22.750
How can we meet them?

23:24.260 --> 23:26.100
Maybe she had a dream.

23:31.420 --> 23:33.550
Have you really never met an immortal?

23:34.300 --> 23:35.940
Of course not.

23:36.690 --> 23:38.090
If I can meet an immortal,

23:38.140 --> 23:39.060
I'll let you know first,

23:39.060 --> 23:39.780
okay?

23:40.500 --> 23:41.100
By the way,

23:41.620 --> 23:43.100
I don't know your name yet.

23:44.300 --> 23:45.360
My name is Liu Shao.

23:47.180 --> 23:47.940
Liu Shao?

23:51.460 --> 23:53.390
The moon is on the tip of the willow.

23:53.460 --> 23:54.520
That's a good name.

23:57.260 --> 23:59.520
Didn't you say you want to catch the moon?

23:59.860 --> 24:01.580
We're already on the moon.

24:01.580 --> 24:02.180
Look.

24:05.690 --> 24:06.380
Wow.

24:06.740 --> 24:08.740
What a beautiful moon shadow!

24:09.050 --> 24:10.420
I'm going to catch the moon.

24:10.420 --> 24:11.140
Wait for me.

24:12.100 --> 24:12.780
Okay.

24:22.820 --> 24:23.380
Hello?

24:24.260 --> 24:25.500
Are you okay?

24:31.740 --> 24:32.700
Hello?

24:36.900 --> 24:38.300
I don't want the moon, okay?

24:38.300 --> 24:39.730
Don't scare me.

24:41.620 --> 24:42.980
Come up.

24:48.020 --> 24:49.660
I found you a treasure

24:49.780 --> 24:50.780
and you don't want it?

24:50.780 --> 24:51.340
No.

24:51.820 --> 24:52.660
Come down.

24:52.970 --> 24:54.020
Why are you

24:54.020 --> 24:54.940
all dry?

24:55.260 --> 24:55.990
Are you okay?

24:56.700 --> 24:57.940
I know the Water-repellent Spell.

24:57.940 --> 24:58.540
I'm fine.

24:58.980 --> 25:00.820
You said you're not an immortal?

25:01.020 --> 25:02.020
Stop pretending.

25:09.180 --> 25:10.140
This is it?

25:10.410 --> 25:11.420
Such a big clam shell.

25:11.420 --> 25:12.460
Are you kidding me?

25:12.460 --> 25:13.460
Of course not.

25:13.940 --> 25:14.870
Close your eyes.

25:20.580 --> 25:21.510
Close your eyes.

25:29.090 --> 25:29.820
Close your eyes.

25:29.820 --> 25:31.210
Okay. I can't see.

25:36.580 --> 25:37.180
All right.

25:37.820 --> 25:38.300
Look.

25:45.060 --> 25:46.180
So beautiful.

26:01.020 --> 26:01.540
Wow.

26:01.860 --> 26:03.420
What a beautiful bracelet.

26:03.900 --> 26:04.830
Isn't it pretty?

26:05.300 --> 26:06.740
But what about the moon?

26:07.330 --> 26:08.660
Didn't you tell me

26:08.660 --> 26:10.590
to catch the moon in the Moon River?

26:10.820 --> 26:11.500
Is it

26:11.700 --> 26:12.420
this?

26:13.780 --> 26:14.710
Look carefully.

26:34.380 --> 26:35.660
You are now on the moon.

26:36.330 --> 26:37.860
And there is the starry sky.

27:04.860 --> 27:06.100
Your life

27:07.020 --> 27:08.540
should be wonderful.

27:09.780 --> 27:11.510
You will see mountains, rivers

27:12.340 --> 27:14.420
and the stars of the four seas.

27:19.780 --> 27:20.710
Is it beautiful?

27:21.930 --> 27:22.590
Take it off.

27:24.740 --> 27:25.380
What?

27:25.820 --> 27:27.180
I'm just showing you.

27:27.180 --> 27:28.340
I'm going to sell it.

27:28.340 --> 27:29.070
Don't cheat.

27:29.900 --> 27:30.660
Oh, right.

27:35.380 --> 27:36.980
This bracelet is amazing.

27:37.260 --> 27:38.420
If you want to sell it,

27:38.420 --> 27:39.880
why don't you sell it to me?

27:40.900 --> 27:41.460
Miss,

27:42.220 --> 27:43.700
this bracelet is unusual.

27:44.260 --> 27:45.380
This bracelet is made by

27:45.380 --> 27:47.140
the Lake Demon's one eye

27:47.370 --> 27:49.180
to raise her children.

27:49.380 --> 27:51.240
It was formed in the golden clams.

27:51.700 --> 27:52.900
It's very expensive.

27:53.500 --> 27:54.700
Don't think about it.

27:55.620 --> 27:56.540
But

27:56.700 --> 27:58.020
the winter is coming.

27:58.290 --> 27:59.740
I'll talk to them then.

28:00.140 --> 28:01.940
Don't dig another eye

28:01.940 --> 28:03.180
for their children.

28:03.460 --> 28:04.420
I will take the bracelet.

28:04.420 --> 28:06.420
I will take the other eye of them too.

28:09.700 --> 28:10.740
Miss,

28:11.060 --> 28:11.900
this bracelet

28:12.140 --> 28:14.020
is at price of their lives.

28:14.940 --> 28:15.780
The price

28:16.370 --> 28:17.180
is not low.

28:18.780 --> 28:20.060
2,000 taels.

28:21.300 --> 28:22.300
Miss, you...

28:22.300 --> 28:23.090
5,000 taels.

28:23.460 --> 28:25.220
That's the maximum I can afford.

28:25.220 --> 28:26.340
Really.

28:26.340 --> 28:27.660
That's all I got

28:27.660 --> 28:28.820
this time.

28:28.940 --> 28:29.740
Besides,

28:30.450 --> 28:31.980
the money is with her.

28:31.980 --> 28:33.100
I don't have any.

28:33.740 --> 28:34.340
Who?

28:35.420 --> 28:36.330
Miss Xiaolian?

28:37.940 --> 28:38.380
Yes.

28:39.460 --> 28:40.590
The one on the shore?

28:41.420 --> 28:43.150
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

28:43.500 --> 28:44.660
It’s too late.

28:44.660 --> 28:46.540
We can't keep her waiting.

28:48.290 --> 28:48.930
By the way,

28:49.140 --> 28:49.820
don't

28:50.060 --> 28:51.180
take it off.

28:51.580 --> 28:53.180
It can ward off evil spirits.

28:56.140 --> 28:56.980
I'm back.

28:58.020 --> 28:58.540
Master.

28:58.980 --> 28:59.940
According to what you said,

28:59.940 --> 29:01.580
I've given her the Lake Bracelet.

29:01.580 --> 29:03.010
She was very happy.

29:03.300 --> 29:04.560
She gave me some money.

29:04.690 --> 29:05.330
I

29:05.900 --> 29:07.820
bought you some good medicine.

29:07.900 --> 29:09.900
It will definitely cure your cough.

29:10.260 --> 29:11.140
How do you know

29:11.140 --> 29:13.180
she would come to the Moon River to find me?

29:13.180 --> 29:14.340
She also asked me about

29:14.340 --> 29:15.100
the immortal.

29:15.100 --> 29:15.740
However,

29:16.180 --> 29:17.180
you told me

29:17.420 --> 29:18.620
the IImmortal Palace

29:18.660 --> 29:20.260
is no longer involved in mortal affairs.

29:20.260 --> 29:22.770
They are all managed by the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

29:22.770 --> 29:23.740
Judging from what she said,

29:23.740 --> 29:24.500
maybe

29:24.500 --> 29:26.300
she might have met the immortal.

29:28.020 --> 29:29.780
Did you pretend to be an immortal

29:29.780 --> 29:31.300
and cheat her?

29:32.300 --> 29:33.050
Master.

29:33.900 --> 29:35.420
Don't say that.

29:35.420 --> 29:37.140
She came there herself.

29:37.860 --> 29:39.620
I just took the opportunity.

29:40.410 --> 29:41.380
You've prepared the Lake Bracelet

29:41.380 --> 29:43.100
for ten years.

29:43.100 --> 29:44.220
If you give it to her like this,

29:44.220 --> 29:46.020
I have to sell her at a good price.

29:46.780 --> 29:47.580
But Master,

29:48.460 --> 29:50.590
why did you give her the Lake Bracelet?

29:50.690 --> 29:51.820
You asked me

29:51.820 --> 29:54.660
why Ao Hen came to Miss Liu.

29:56.980 --> 29:58.540
Although she is a mortal,

29:58.660 --> 30:00.460
she has strong spiritual power.

30:01.540 --> 30:04.180
I don't know where she gets it.

30:04.440 --> 30:09.180
[Jade Pavilion]

30:04.700 --> 30:05.500
I just know

30:05.500 --> 30:08.340
this power will awaken at her age of 18

30:08.620 --> 30:10.420
and attract all demons.

30:17.610 --> 30:19.660
With the protection of the Lake Bracelet,

30:19.660 --> 30:20.940
ordinary demons

30:20.940 --> 30:22.700
won't dare to approach her.

30:25.570 --> 30:28.740
This bracelet can really ward off evil spirits.

30:31.140 --> 30:32.940
After Ao Hen's attack this time,

30:34.940 --> 30:37.460
she will definitely go to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke to hide.

30:37.460 --> 30:38.790
With the Lake Bracelet,

30:39.660 --> 30:41.770
she should be safe.

30:43.780 --> 30:44.690
Master,

30:45.100 --> 30:46.020
I think

30:46.220 --> 30:47.380
you're unfair.

30:48.660 --> 30:50.860
You arranged everything for this girl.

30:51.060 --> 30:52.920
Please arrange something for me.

30:53.020 --> 30:53.880
How about this?

30:53.940 --> 30:55.600
I’m killing demons every day.

30:55.620 --> 30:57.180
I can't rest for a day.

30:57.220 --> 30:57.950
-And? -Okay.

30:58.370 --> 31:01.300
Get rid of the scattered demons in the back mountain.

31:17.980 --> 31:19.460
Gosh, I’m so tired.

31:19.820 --> 31:21.680
How many demons am I going to hunt?

31:21.860 --> 31:26.320
If I keep hunting like this, I'll never be able to finish it for the rest of my life.

31:31.570 --> 31:34.220
I wonder if the girl has gone to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

31:34.220 --> 31:37.230
How did you know I was going to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

31:37.230 --> 31:37.660
You...

31:38.740 --> 31:39.380
You...

31:39.500 --> 31:40.560
How did you find me?

31:42.180 --> 31:43.700
Why are you so nervous?

31:45.060 --> 31:46.390
We are destined to meet.

31:46.490 --> 31:47.820
We can meet everywhere.

31:48.100 --> 31:49.100
Am I right?

31:51.380 --> 31:52.220
Oh no.

31:52.700 --> 31:54.230
She's here to ask for money.

31:54.460 --> 31:56.920
Why do you look like you did something wrong?

31:57.660 --> 31:59.060
The bracelet you gave me

31:59.060 --> 32:00.920
can really ward off evil spirits.

32:03.020 --> 32:04.140
Of course.

32:04.900 --> 32:06.140
It works.

32:07.340 --> 32:08.800
This is the Lake Bracelet.

32:08.940 --> 32:11.070
It's a good deal for 5,000 taels, okay?

32:13.540 --> 32:15.260
Go to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke with me to learn.

32:15.260 --> 32:16.740
I can add more money.

32:19.940 --> 32:21.340
Why should I go to such a place

32:21.340 --> 32:23.020
with a spoiled lady like you?

32:23.660 --> 32:24.540
20,000 taels.

32:24.700 --> 32:25.830
Are you going or not?

32:29.570 --> 32:32.430
It's very tiring to go to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

32:34.340 --> 32:35.660
25,000 taels.

32:37.060 --> 32:37.540
Well,

32:37.660 --> 32:38.660
you also know that

32:38.740 --> 32:40.100
my master has a cough.

32:40.100 --> 32:41.300
He needs me.

32:42.170 --> 32:42.980
30,000 taels?

32:49.300 --> 32:50.570
People in the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke

32:50.570 --> 32:52.230
need to go out to catch demons.

32:52.540 --> 32:54.220
My life will be in danger.

32:54.570 --> 32:55.580
This cost is huge.

32:55.580 --> 32:57.310
You must add 10,000 taels more.

32:59.740 --> 33:00.540
Miss Liu,

33:03.060 --> 33:03.860
I plan to

33:04.260 --> 33:07.320
let Li go to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke with you tomorrow

33:07.340 --> 33:10.140
to attend the recruitment competition tomorrow.

33:10.220 --> 33:10.740
Okay.

33:14.020 --> 33:14.660
Master,

33:15.540 --> 33:16.980
if you want to arrange things for me,

33:16.980 --> 33:18.780
can you come back a little later?

33:19.060 --> 33:20.460
Wait until I negotiate the price.

33:20.460 --> 33:21.660
Do you have a problem?

33:23.500 --> 33:23.940
No.

33:24.780 --> 33:25.700
Miss Liu,

33:26.460 --> 33:28.020
please go back and rest.

33:28.170 --> 33:30.500
Lu Li will pick you up tomorrow morning.

33:34.660 --> 33:36.140
Mr. Lu, see you tomorrow.

33:46.140 --> 33:47.460
I heard it with my own ears.

33:47.460 --> 33:49.500
Liu Shao said she would leave tomorrow morning

33:49.500 --> 33:50.860
to attend the recruitment competition

33:50.860 --> 33:51.860
tomorrow.

33:52.180 --> 33:52.980
Your Majesty.

33:53.220 --> 33:53.860
Please spare me.

33:53.860 --> 33:55.220
That's all I know.

33:55.780 --> 33:56.900
I can keep investigating.

33:56.900 --> 33:58.900
Your Majesty, please spare my life.

34:21.699 --> 34:22.540
It seems

34:22.940 --> 34:24.460
the tonic energy of Liu Shao

34:24.460 --> 34:26.219
will be mine

34:26.219 --> 34:28.580
soon.

34:30.100 --> 34:33.139
Back then, I only killed a few people from the Immortal Palace.

34:33.139 --> 34:34.900
Yin was badly injured by them.

34:34.900 --> 34:35.460
Yin.

34:36.139 --> 34:37.179
Yin, are you okay?

34:37.460 --> 34:38.139
Yin.

34:39.659 --> 34:40.659
You can't escape.

34:41.630 --> 34:42.639
[Son of Ao Hen, Ao Yin]

34:43.980 --> 34:45.380
Although we escaped,

34:46.130 --> 34:47.730
my son was seriously injured

34:48.100 --> 34:49.960
and returned to the infant state.

34:51.020 --> 34:52.980
I will help you catch Liu Shao

34:53.500 --> 34:56.580
and pass the power in her body to you.

35:02.980 --> 35:04.460
Pass my order.

35:04.940 --> 35:06.930
I want that girl

35:07.420 --> 35:10.150
won't be able to enter the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

35:50.020 --> 35:50.650
Master,

35:51.380 --> 35:53.180
your steamed pear soup is ready.

35:57.140 --> 35:58.540
You're ready to go?

35:58.940 --> 35:59.890
Don't worry.

36:00.620 --> 36:01.940
I can live wherever I go.

36:01.940 --> 36:02.980
I'm always ready.

36:05.260 --> 36:05.940
But Master,

36:06.540 --> 36:09.400
why do you want me to go to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

36:12.260 --> 36:12.900
Li,

36:14.140 --> 36:15.140
do you remember

36:15.820 --> 36:17.780
the Moon Sword I mentioned to you?

36:19.460 --> 36:19.980
Yes.

36:21.660 --> 36:23.060
I remember what you said.

36:23.980 --> 36:26.110
As long as the Moon Sword is pulled out,

36:26.140 --> 36:27.820
I will know who I am.

36:26.880 --> 36:30.740
[Moon Sword]

36:42.020 --> 36:42.700
Li.

36:44.940 --> 36:48.070
The Moon Sword is actually in the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

36:49.020 --> 36:51.260
Now that the Mysterious Light has appeared,

36:51.260 --> 36:52.620
it means it's time.

36:54.380 --> 36:56.020
You have to protect Liu Shao.

36:57.140 --> 36:59.620
She's the key to pull out the Moon Sword.

37:03.180 --> 37:04.140
Damn Lu Li!

37:04.500 --> 37:06.980
He promised to pick me up, but where is he?

37:08.420 --> 37:09.540
I can't wait for him.

37:09.540 --> 37:11.200
I can't miss the recruitment.

37:15.140 --> 37:16.620
What's that sound?

37:30.100 --> 37:31.740
Are you also going to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke

37:31.740 --> 37:33.060
for the competition?

37:33.500 --> 37:34.380
-Yes. -Yes.

37:34.580 --> 37:35.240
Yes, we are.

37:36.130 --> 37:37.190
Let's go together.

37:37.260 --> 37:38.060
-Sure. -Sure.

37:38.300 --> 37:38.940
Please.

37:38.940 --> 37:39.380
Okay.

37:55.580 --> 37:56.090
I...

37:57.460 --> 37:58.320
Where are they?

38:02.540 --> 38:04.140
Where did the wind come from?

38:08.420 --> 38:09.900
It's so sunny.

38:10.220 --> 38:12.260
Why do I feel so cold on my back?

38:16.260 --> 38:19.210
Aren't there many recruiters in the recruitment of the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

38:19.210 --> 38:20.980
Why is there no one here?

38:25.230 --> 38:27.540
[Mansion of Wu Yang Duke]

38:40.500 --> 38:42.560
So this is the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

38:42.820 --> 38:43.940
I'm here

38:43.940 --> 38:45.060
without Lu Li.

38:50.060 --> 38:51.340
-Miss, are you alright? -You...

38:51.340 --> 38:52.500
Ignore her.

38:53.940 --> 38:54.820
My name is Wang Jian.

38:54.820 --> 38:56.820
I'm here to attend the competition.

38:57.100 --> 38:57.900
Just like you.

38:58.140 --> 38:59.200
My name is Liu Shao.

38:59.780 --> 39:00.660
Let's do it.

39:01.300 --> 39:01.830
Let's go.

39:11.060 --> 39:12.500
What are you thinking?

39:13.060 --> 39:14.890
He would have come if he wanted to.

39:14.890 --> 39:15.540
Liu Shao.

39:16.900 --> 39:17.460
Coming.

39:32.740 --> 39:33.980
If fate is not over,

39:34.780 --> 39:36.180
we will eventually meet.

39:37.800 --> 39:39.730
I'll use these three days to verify

39:40.080 --> 39:42.610
if you're the person I'm looking for.

39:43.740 --> 39:45.540
This is unfair to you.

39:46.300 --> 39:47.560
But this is the only way

39:48.260 --> 39:50.980
to save the world.

39:53.180 --> 39:54.020
Liu Shao,

39:55.450 --> 39:56.340
your fate

39:58.420 --> 40:00.100
has begun.

40:02.300 --> 40:03.580
Unfortunately,

40:05.100 --> 40:07.410
I can't see that day.

40:35.060 --> 40:36.990
It's a plan for thousands of years.

40:37.340 --> 40:39.060
Now it's time

40:40.060 --> 40:41.300
to begin.

40:44.820 --> 40:45.620
Master.

40:46.500 --> 40:47.580
I had a dream.

40:51.180 --> 40:51.780
I dreamed

40:51.970 --> 40:54.100
I was flying with a girl in the sky.

40:55.900 --> 40:58.180
Everything is just as the Supreme God said.

40:58.180 --> 40:59.700
We've been waiting for ten thousand years.

40:59.700 --> 41:01.430
Finally, everything is ready.

41:03.300 --> 41:04.140
Master.

41:04.260 --> 41:05.210
Where are you?

41:07.220 --> 41:07.900
Master.
